---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="分享" description="分享这个个人小站的入口。">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">分享</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-slate-400">几个可以直接打开的站内入口。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      <a href="/" class="surface-soft motion-card block rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-5" aria-label="打开首页">
        <p class="text-xs text-sky-300/80">入口</p>
        <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-white">首页</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">回到博客首页，查看最新文章。</p>
        <span class="mt-4 inline-flex rounded bg-[#0f1115] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-slate-400">最新</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/tools/" class="surface-soft motion-card block rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-5" aria-label="打开日常">
        <p class="text-xs text-sky-300/80">入口</p>
        <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-white">日常</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">一些最近常出现在生活里的小东西。</p>
        <span class="mt-4 inline-flex rounded bg-[#0f1115] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-slate-400">工具</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/about/" class="surface-soft motion-card block rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-5" aria-label="打开关于">
        <p class="text-xs text-sky-300/80">入口</p>
        <h2 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-white">关于</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">了解这个小站和站长的更多信息。</p>
        <span class="mt-4 inline-flex rounded bg-[#0f1115] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-slate-400">关于</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
